{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead your army and forge an empire in intense third-person real-time battles.</strong> Face dynamic environments with varying difficulty levels that will test your tactical skills. Adapt your strategy, command your troops, and claim victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Army customization:</strong> Choose your troops, customize their colors, and design your banner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565740/extras/3096ac4d8a649582c845d82982682cec.poster.avif?t=1769621117\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565740/extras/3096ac4d8a649582c845d82982682cec.webm?t=1769621117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565740/extras/3096ac4d8a649582c845d82982682cec.mp4?t=1769621117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Hero customization:</strong> Modify your hero's appearance and stats to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565740/extras/79afc79e0bd394b2ce50cb4bdcf88394.poster.avif?t=1769621117\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565740/extras/79afc79e0bd394b2ce50cb4bdcf88394.webm?t=1769621117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565740/extras/79afc79e0bd394b2ce50cb4bdcf88394.mp4?t=1769621117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Unlock new units and gear:</strong> Win battles to gain access to better troops and equipment.<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Strategy and formations:</strong> Plan the positioning and formation of your troops to gain a tactical advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565740/extras/f3281569f15081d3ccd79a21b0b45122.poster.avif?t=1769621117\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565740/extras/f3281569f15081d3ccd79a21b0b45122.webm?t=1769621117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565740/extras/f3281569f15081d3ccd79a21b0b45122.mp4?t=1769621117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Siege and fortress defense:</strong> Capture the enemy\u2019s flag to take control of their economy, but be prepared to defend your own stronghold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565740/extras/edb3505a4dc80997acc9eacd359f6915.poster.avif?t=1769621117\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565740/extras/edb3505a4dc80997acc9eacd359f6915.webm?t=1769621117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565740/extras/edb3505a4dc80997acc9eacd359f6915.mp4?t=1769621117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Siege weaponry:</strong> Adapt to challenging battlefields by deploying powerful war machines to turn the tide of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565740/extras/d923511a4c9681448f23c8a63654d259.po